<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BJ's Wholesale begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BJ's Wholesale begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities started coverage of BJ's Wholesale Club with a buy rating, a source at the brokerage firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BJ's Wholesale was spun-off from Waban Inc to shareholders on July 28.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 29-6/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
